<title>USA: J.B. Hunt Transport signs 5 year contract.</title>
<headline>J.B. Hunt Transport signs 5 year contract.</headline>
<dateline>LOWELL, Ark. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.B. Hunt Transport Services Inc said Friday it had signed a five-year agreement with J.C. Penney Co Inc to manage a portion of its truckload and intermodal transportation.</p>
<p>J.B. Hunt will handle J.C. Penney's intermodal shipments, while Swift Transportation Co Inc will handle about a third of its truckload shipments, J.B. Hunt said.</p>
<p>J.B. Hunt said it will use a group of preferred carriers to handle the balance of the volume of shipments covered by the agreement.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
